# Beneath the Mask (crystalWar 49), the Prog 0 zone-in from any zone (Task 5 review Minor 2): a level 99 Warrior in
# Pashhow Marshlands [S] with Honor Under Fire completed and the WotG mission Fate in Haze current (missions as the main
# flow); the quest accepted at Prog 0 (GMs). The main flow enters Beadeaux [S] at Prog 0 from Bastok Markets [S]; here
# from Pashhow Marshlands [S]: 1 all the same (left open), finished: Prog 1. Prog 1: Beadeaux from Pashhow again:
# nothing.
lists BeadeauxS/onZoneIn/1 BeadeauxS/onEventFinish/1
char zone=PashhowMarshlandsS pos=-384.102,21.97,456.359 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.HonorUnderFire completed
quest CrystalWar.BeneathTheMask accepted
mission Wotg FateInHaze current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
warp -297.109,0.008,96.002 BeadeauxS open # from Pashhow Marshlands [S] at Prog 0: 1, left open
finish                                  # Prog 1
warp -384.102,21.97,456.359 PashhowMarshlandsS
warp -297.109,0.008,96.002 BeadeauxS    # from Pashhow Marshlands [S] at Prog 1: nothing
